        "<picture 1> A completely ordinary man in a green field jacket, gray T-shirt, jeans, and sneakers stands alone on a quiet rooftop plaza at night. He looks confused and slightly nervous, breathing naturally as the wind moves his jacket. Medium-wide handheld shot, realistic body movement, cinematic anime rendering.\n\nHe notices a plain spear lying beside him, quickly grabs it with both hands, steps forward, rotates his torso, and throws it with all his strength toward the right side of the frame. The camera rapidly arcs around him and pushes closer during the throw. At the exact moment the spear leaves his hand, dozens of enormous circular golden portals ignite behind him one after another, expanding across the entire sky in layered depth. Each portal contains a different spear, sword, axe, or polearm aimed in the same direction.\n\nThe thrown spear becomes wrapped in brilliant gold-white energy and streaks forward with a powerful shockwave. The weapons inside the portals immediately launch after it in a massive synchronized barrage, filling the air with glowing trails, sparks, and swirling magical particles. The ordinary man remains visibly shocked by what he has just summoned, his arm still extended from the throw. Dramatic low-angle camera, strong wind, clothing and hair reacting to the blast, intense golden illumination against the dark blue night, smooth continuous motion, clear transformation from mundane reality into overwhelming mythic spectacle.",
